    },
    {
      "id": "A26699-zh-00027",
      "source_hash": "372647e8fb5ca2d2a7b60c2a8278f50021abd02fa4bb2c827c57c7c99d32b7b5",
      "text": "依照《防止人口贩运等及保护受害者等法》第二十九条第一款、同法施行令第二十条第二款及"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26699-zh-00028",
      "source_hash": "e9473b3a41d8ede5084c0cb772465fa0e58e1e49adfa45172eebc50aed600768",
      "text": "同法施行规则第七条第一款，申请指定上述专责医疗机构。"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26699-zh-00031",
      "source_hash": "1bfa95cfdfb79f2ff0ecd2412e922b1aeb3936cb6a915f5ec6569fc9388a5768",
      "text": "日"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26699-zh-00034",
      "source_hash": "fc7b3ed4206b66df52cc1e4cb490201db862b42bd3a78b2187ddc356dcadb31c",
      "text": "性别平等家庭部部长、特别市长、广域市长、道知事"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26699-zh-00036",
      "source_hash": "9170dd7a099e9a3c170bade681381d2fdb0c637188c7b0f05d4447fec48577cb",
      "text": "特别自治市长、特别自治道知事、市长、郡守、区厅长"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26699-zh-00038",
      "source_hash": "eaaf67da3672ea147838955c5b1dc2bbaf0ea2ae0b2baafeaab332c1b722dfc1",
      "text": "1. 法人章程（仅限申请人为法人）"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26699-zh-00039",
      "source_hash": "0313408cdf794fea03a1b1d6758e8ad6cc7c6a9f70b7256de98dafab6a45bf1a",
      "text": "手续费"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26699-zh-00040",
      "source_hash": "9b9f765e005f6811c5e986daa041057cea83f9af6c19ca7d70a7ef3c9ab707c9",
      "text": "提交文件"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26699-zh-00041",
      "source_hash": "60e7e127fa47350f9b4e57d786ead652cd16b4bc4439df4b30b0a8a198a8505d",
      "text": "2. 证明属于《防止人口贩运等及保护受害者等法施行令》第二十条第一款各项所列"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26699-zh-00042",
      "source_hash": "72ea3d64ace5bc9414498b815d4305c8867b0942a508179e0657ad60d1274daa",
      "text": "无"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26699-zh-00043",
      "source_hash": "7da47576431341a342fbbe85664edc486e575aa5d18c82bcd3ef14d59f4c68c0",
      "text": "医疗机构类型的文件"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26699-zh-00044",
      "source_hash": "b827c74bf8d6e87420e0f5fbb59551e36f9d2f125502ccc70f9f11139bd8294d",
      "text": "经办公务员"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26699-zh-00045",
      "source_hash": "4236e13cff2fc275a6feae03a45c519bc07957a3eb60d3fa0f341e0a33dbcdba",
      "text": "申请人无需提交的文件"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26699-zh-00046",
      "source_hash": "db9efdd62ca7a22d7a85fd588aee08ce707abe419b5b52377d0a3a24f31070a7",
      "text": "法人登记事项证明书"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26699-zh-00047",
      "source_hash": "1a5be3c5938c8c2cedf096bb1485ce5f53335572edc7c3dbbf132e7bf9927045",
      "text": "核实事项"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26699-zh-00048",
      "source_hash": "c88c8339a7fb4000b1bc2b6aeec9d618ff91843d81bcbdebe537ebbc6bdf3ec8",
      "text": "不同意核实时申请人须自行提交的文件"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26699-zh-00049",
      "source_hash": "0172f1378d584a298b8a9ea70a13c2995edafe45e91b4e7c439381bd06cb119d",
      "text": "营业者登记证"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26699-zh-00050",
      "source_hash": "7a75dfb4f98958b7a32c3f19046d3b04a2959a4b408c360771276c41f7f9e542",
      "text": "行政信息共同利用同意书"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26699-zh-00051",
      "source_hash": "c9b10df2527127ea18b556946c54ecd34af4184b48195d70f5331c986474353a",
      "text": "本人同意经办公务员为办理本申请，依《电子政府法》第三十六条第一款，通过行政信息共同利用机制"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26699-zh-00052",
      "source_hash": "aa8b7277f41a88c59e2c7cbd4dd2d79a949c80071850395f7d79bd96424d22be",
      "text": "核实上述经办公务员核实事项。* 如不同意，申请人须自行提交相关文件。"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26699-zh-00056",
      "source_hash": "2879222415672d201abfe3e634d8339e67e1459aae97a4f34b023760aaf0d94f",
      "text": "办理流程"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26699-zh-00057",
      "source_hash": "d756749ae151055bb3f2fb59a27fb00c3964fefb2a90809570b03e8c0189e1ab",
      "text": "申请书"
    },
    {
      "id": "A26699-zh-00058",
      "source_hash": "d995d6ab415d91d191bafde064de400b1e66d82532d91ec0cc02d72258ce5cda",
